{"about_the_game":"<strong>Kinetic Storm</strong> is a top-down arena shooter where you destroy waves of enemies and select upgrades at the end of the wave. It is a roguelike, so enemies and upgrades are randomly generated, and every play-through is radically different as you discover synergies between your weapon, skill, movement, and defence choices. Running on a custom Vulkan game engine, it is both visually stunning and highly performant with responsive low-latency controls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful weapons</h2><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56584f995fdcccfab5a5f6df0dcfbf1b.poster.avif?t=1745263622\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56584f995fdcccfab5a5f6df0dcfbf1b.webm?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56584f995fdcccfab5a5f6df0dcfbf1b.mp4?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Before each run select your primary and secondary weapon. Focus on upgrading one, or carefully choose useful upgrades for each.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/58311c6eeeca599d97a12acff9c4a3ec.poster.avif?t=1745263622\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/58311c6eeeca599d97a12acff9c4a3ec.webm?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/58311c6eeeca599d97a12acff9c4a3ec.mp4?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Useful skills</h2><br>Manage your energy levels to make best use of your skills. A dash at just the right time can save your ship, or destroy masses of enemies ... if you have the right upgrades.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56c8babbd4ae2934884566b5df02de1b.poster.avif?t=1745263622\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56c8babbd4ae2934884566b5df02de1b.webm?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/56c8babbd4ae2934884566b5df02de1b.mp4?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique enemies</h2><br>Enemies are carefully designed to each have distinct abilities and defences. Some are deadly up close, others from far away, or only from some angles. Which will you destroy first?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/b704d4b1da9e1782b3ab678ec7098937.poster.avif?t=1745263622\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/b704d4b1da9e1782b3ab678ec7098937.webm?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/b704d4b1da9e1782b3ab678ec7098937.mp4?t=1745263622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly bosses</h2><br>Challenge massive and terrifying boss enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless upgrades</h2><br>Your reward for survival is ever increasing power and destructive ability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/extras/07ecc77d10b6a49188bab2905afaaea8.avif?t=1745263622\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2154430/247ae4e12ef133c11f4a58ccc81d98c466700bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Brutal wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2154430/825e84f57cb9732547098ebf95875ce7c1ddf56c.jpg"},{"name":"Snake boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2154430/c0e724a4a436cf1d7ea83131336fda6ca275cc56.jpg"},{"name":"Tentacle boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2154430/c19ae5d3b5da3048df35de4c821438d629a9899a.jpg"},{"name":"Tentacle boss (hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2154430/46299e48149c85690ad3e1ae4908e33f55df03a3.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2154430?t=1745263622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745263622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745263622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2154430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745263622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<strong>Kinetic Storm</strong> is a top-down arena shooter where you destroy waves of enemies and select upgrades at the end of the wave. It is a roguelike, so enemies and upgrades are randomly generated, and every play-through is radically different as you discover synergies between your weapon, skill, movement, and defence choices. Running on a custom Vulkan game engine, it is both visually stunning